The '''2018 Baliscan premiership election''' was held on 1 December 2018 to elect the [[Secretary General of Balisca]]. It took place following the [[2018 Baliscan confederal election]]. [[Andrea Palacios]] won the election with 50.04% of the vote, narrowly defeating insurgent candidate [[Josuè Subirà]].

A total of 78 million people voted in the election, reaching a voter turnout of 76.75%. 

